  witness cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/tests/world_native_material_test.sh proves a published /w/collection-proof World resolves only its named published PublicationOccurrence source_collection before native composition and contains the selected public publication material; unpublished and wrong-kind collections remain unable to feed a public World
