  source world-publication
  destination internet-census
  relation reads
  preserves the extraction contract exactly as the census authored it; a world names sources and never how to parse one
  preserves the refusal and the tier; a world over a frozen source shows what it read, which is nothing
  drops the cadence; a publication reads on open and does not schedule anything
  forbidden_inference a source named by a world -> a source that answered
  forbidden_inference a composed feed -> an endorsement of what is in it

