architecture design-fingerprint
  canonical_name DesignFingerprint
  family surface
  domain Surface / Measured design language
  layer surface
  semantic_question Which closed visual grammar was measured from a reference, without importing that reference as code?
  purpose The Ghost reference compiler lowers each marketplace reference into both a PresentationTemplate and a DesignFingerprint. The fingerprint holds only a closed visual vector and renderer affinity, so a lowering tournament can compare typography, density, media and geometry without treating a donor theme as an executable dependency or a visual choice as a semantic claim.
  maturity declared
