  invariant a fingerprint records presentation evidence only and neither reads semantic owners nor grants authority
  invariant a public-page anatomy observation retains only source URL, digests and bounded structural measurements; it never retains or imports donor HTML, CSS, JavaScript, images or runtime code
  invariant an observed public reference remains unselected renderer evidence until separate masthead, hero, editorial sequence, media geometry, responsive, interaction and semantic-slot acceptance is measured
  invariant every vector is reproducible from the checked-in census and every selected key belongs to the bounded visual vocabulary
  cannot_infer a DesignFingerprint -> copied Ghost code, a Ghost backend, paid assets, semantic truth, source admission, audience entitlement or an authority to act
  cannot_infer visual similarity -> a material claim, suitability or a right to publish
  witness cmd/BonfyreCMS/Makefile presentation-template-test emits and validates exactly 238 unique reference candidates and vectors, explicitly marked not selectable SiteProfiles
