architecture site-presentation-composition
  canonical_name SitePresentationComposition
  family surface
  domain Surface / Site compiler
  layer surface
  semantic_question How does one addressed Aurekai site select a studied visual profile and lower real applications into typed visual slots?
  purpose SitePresentation is the mutable CMS selection of one GhostProfile for one addressed subject and territory. SiteProgram is the executable many-to-many composition over that addressed selection: it names experience programs, typed application bindings, portable renderer preferences, source collections, carrier subprograms and actor presentation cells without duplicating identity or art direction. SemanticSlot describes profile geometry and accepted typed applications; SourceCollection groups external reagents without treating them as content; ApplicationBinding lowers a real application into a slot; CapabilityProgram remains below the human action as the carrier tournament; ExperienceStage is an executable typed-application graph instead of prose chain stages.
  maturity declared
