  known_gap current public donor shells still contain legacy browser renderers. They must be replaced aperture-by-aperture by native initial HTML and HTMX fragment boundaries from this composition contract; no generic external-estate card lowerer may substitute for that work
  known_gap Agriculture now has native PublicationFeed, Community, Board, Listen and Watch lowerers with an explicit WeatherObservation empty state. It still needs a real WeatherObservation owner/lowerer, Ghost profile slot geometry, HTMX refresh contracts and the remaining application lowerers before it can replace an established public donor surface.

