architecture territory-door
  canonical_name TerritoryDoor
  family surface
  domain Surface / Front door
  layer surface
  semantic_question How does the one public arrival aperture acquire a distinct, lawful territory character without becoming four unrelated applications?
  purpose The presentation component beneath TerritoryLanding. The public root now has one immediate operation and fixed owner doors, so it no longer reorders a dashboard of live sections. Matrix resolves the territory and the native lowerer reads the matching published territory_presentation CMS row into only its explicitly authored template slots. It does not own the form operation, session, weather source, Discovery, Market, or Studio.
  maturity implemented
  source_path cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/src/territory_home.c
  source_path cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/src/territory_home.h
  source_path cmd/BonfyreCMS/content-types/territory_presentation.json
  source_path cmd/BonfyreCMS/data/territory-presentations.jsonl
  source_path site/matrix/surfaces/build/install_authored_rows.mjs
  witness site/matrix/surfaces/build/authored_rows.test.mjs imports four authored territory doors into a local CMS and rejects duplicate keys before a second import
  source_path site/matrix/surfaces/home.html
  consumes TerritoryLanding
  consumes AddressPlane
  publishes DerivedView
  internal_calculus Matrix resolves the controlled host to one territory; native Web lowering reads the matching published CMS row and applies only its bounded authored element IDs and body class in the static home grammar before the response is sent. The host is never a query parameter. A CMS outage retains the neutral grammar while Matrix still applies its resolved territory class; it cannot replace the native operation or manufacture a territory-specific fact.
  invariant a door differs in visual character and immediate question, not just a color token; all four must remain recognizably separate while retaining the same bounded public operation
  invariant published territory_presentation owns all specialized human wording; native C only addresses its closed template slots after controlled-host selection, and URL query input cannot choose another territory's language
  invariant a character never changes the URL submitted to intake or the owner of a later Discover, Market, Studio, session, or weather operation
  cannot_infer a door character -> authority, membership, address ownership, a readable closure, or a completed action behind one of its doors
  witness cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/tests/territory_home_test.c proves four published territory_presentation CMS rows specialize only bounded authored IDs and an independent row cannot manufacture copy; cmd/BonfyreWebAddress/tests/web_address_test.sh proves Matrix still specializes four HTTP body classes without browser execution when the CMS resilience floor is active

